---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "10-Day No-Call Finish-It with Sue | Knit by Machine";
const pageDescription = "Get unstuck, get moving, and finally finish—one doable step at a time. A 10-day, call-free coaching sprint with personalized guidance from Sue.";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <div class="sales-page">
    
    <section class="hero-section">
      <h1 data-testid="text-page-title">10-Day No-Call Finish-It with Sue</h1>
      <p class="tagline" data-testid="text-tagline">Get unstuck, get moving, and finally finish—one doable step at a time.</p>
      <p class="intro-text" data-testid="text-intro">
        If your project is sitting half-done—and you're tired of feeling stuck—this 10-day, call-free sprint gives you a clear plan and gentle accountability. You choose the project, Sue breaks it into simple steps, and you move forward at your own pace. No calls. No pressure. Just progress you can feel.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="#pricing" class="kbm-button kbm-button--primary" data-testid="button-cta-hero">Begin the 10-Day Finish</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-who">Who This Is For</h2>
      <p>This 10-day coaching sprint is designed for knitters who want support without the pressure of calls or video meetings. It's perfect if:</p>
      <ul class="feature-list" data-testid="list-who">
        <li>You have a project that's been sitting half-done for weeks (or months).</li>
        <li>You're overwhelmed, frustrated, or not sure what the next step should be.</li>
        <li>You want support—but not calls, meetings, or pressure.</li>
        <li>You work best at your own pace and on your own schedule.</li>
        <li>You want a short, structured plan to help you build momentum and actually finish.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-what">What You'll Get</h2>
      <p>During your 10 days, you'll receive personalized support designed to keep you moving forward:</p>
      
      <div class="benefits-list" data-testid="list-benefits">
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h3>A clear, custom plan for your project</h3>
          <p>Sue will break your project into small, manageable steps based on where you are right now—so you know exactly what to do next.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h3>Daily guidance (without calls)</h3>
          <p>Check in when you're ready, and Sue will respond with clear, practical advice—no scheduling, no video, no waiting for an appointment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h3>Gentle accountability</h3>
          <p>Sometimes you just need someone in your corner. Sue is here to encourage you, celebrate small wins, and help you stay on track.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h3>Practical help when you get stuck</h3>
          <p>If something doesn't look right, doesn't feel right, or you're just not sure—Sue will help you figure it out and move forward.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <h3>A real finish (or unstoppable momentum toward it)</h3>
          <p>By the end of your 10 days, you'll either have a finished project—or the clarity and confidence to finish on your own.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-why">Why No-Call Coaching Works So Well</h2>
      <p>
        Many knitters feel stuck—not because they don't have skills, but because they need someone to help them see the next step clearly. Calls and video meetings can feel like a lot of pressure. Scheduling is hard. And sometimes you just need time to think before you try something new.
      </p>
      <p>No-call coaching gives you:</p>
      <ul class="feature-list" data-testid="list-why">
        <li>Time to think</li>
        <li>A clear path</li>
        <li>Someone who can spot the next best step</li>
        <li>Encouragement that fits their pace</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This format removes the pressure of scheduling and Zoom—so you can focus on knitting, not logistics.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-how">How It Works</h2>
      <p>Getting started is simple. Here's the process:</p>
      <ol class="numbered-list" data-testid="list-how">
        <li><strong>Sign Up & Tell Sue About Your Project</strong> — Share what you're working on, where you're stuck, and what you'd like to finish.</li>
        <li><strong>Receive Your Custom 10-Day Plan</strong> — Sue will create a step-by-step plan tailored to your project and your pace.</li>
        <li><strong>Share Updates When You're Ready</strong> — Check in whenever it works for you—no daily requirement, no pressure.</li>
        <li><strong>Get Clear, Simple Next Steps</strong> — Each time you update, Sue will respond with what to do next.</li>
        <li><strong>Keep Moving Forward</strong> — By the end of 10 days, you'll have finished—or be well on your way.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-projects">What You Can Work On</h2>
      <p>
        This coaching is flexible—you can bring almost any machine knitting project that needs finishing or unsticking. Here are some examples:
      </p>
      <ul class="feature-list" data-testid="list-projects">
        <li>Sweater pieces that need assembly or finishing</li>
        <li>A project stuck on shaping you're not sure how to do</li>
        <li>An off-gauge project that needs adjusting</li>
        <li>A stalled blanket, scarf, or other large project</li>
        <li>A restart you've been avoiding</li>
        <li>A technique you're hesitating to try alone</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-wont-need">What You Won't Need</h2>
      <p>This coaching is designed to fit your life—not add more to it:</p>
      <ul class="feature-list checkmark-list" data-testid="list-wont-need">
        <li>No Zoom</li>
        <li>No phone calls</li>
        <li>No scheduling</li>
        <li>No long lessons</li>
        <li>No pressure</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-results">Results You Can Expect</h2>
      <p>After your 10-day sprint, you'll walk away with:</p>
      <ul class="feature-list" data-testid="list-results">
        <li>A clearer understanding of your machine</li>
        <li>Confidence in what to do next</li>
        <li>A finished project—or the momentum to reach the finish</li>
        <li>Less clutter on your needles</li>
        <li>More joy in your knitting</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section id="pricing" class="pricing-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-pricing">10 Days of Private, No-Call Coaching — $___</h2>
      <p class="pricing-intro">
        A short, focused sprint designed to help you finish with clarity, momentum, and support that fits your schedule.
      </p>
      <ul class="feature-list pricing-features" data-testid="list-pricing-features">
        <li>A personalized plan for your project</li>
        <li>Private, asynchronous guidance from Sue</li>
        <li>Clear next steps each time you check in</li>
        <li>Troubleshooting when something doesn't look or feel right</li>
        <li>Gentle accountability so you keep moving forward</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="#" class="kbm-button kbm-button--primary" data-testid="button-cta-pricing">Begin the 10-Day Finish</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 data-testid="text-faq-q1">How often do I need to check in?</h3>
        <p>As often as you'd like! There's no minimum requirement. Some people check in every day; others send updates every few days. Whatever works for you is fine.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 data-testid="text-faq-q2">What if life gets busy?</h3>
        <p>That's okay. The 10 days are meant to be flexible. If you need to pause, just let Sue know—she'll help you pick back up when you're ready.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 data-testid="text-faq-q3">Can I do more than one project?</h3>
        <p>It's best to focus on one project at a time. That way, you'll make real progress instead of spreading yourself thin. If you finish early, you can always add another!</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 data-testid="text-faq-q4">Is this good for beginners?</h3>
        <p>Absolutely. Whether you're brand new or have been knitting for years, this coaching meets you where you are. Sue adjusts her guidance based on your experience.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3 data-testid="text-faq-q5">What if I feel embarrassed about my progress?</h3>
        <p>Don't be. Sue has seen it all—dropped stitches, tangled yarn, projects that sat for years. There's no judgment here, only encouragement and practical help.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <hr class="kbm-divider" />

    <section class="final-cta-section">
      <h2 data-testid="text-section-final">Ready to finally finish?</h2>
      <p class="final-cta-text">
        10-Day No-Call Finish-It with Sue — Get unstuck, get moving, and finally finish—one doable step at a time.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-wrapper">
        <a href="#pricing" class="kbm-button kbm-button--primary" data-testid="button-cta-final">Begin the 10-Day Finish</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .sales-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .hero-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .hero-section h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    color: var(--kbm-green-2);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .intro-text {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  }

  .cta-wrapper {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .kbm-button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .kbm-button--primary {
    background-color: #52682d;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .kbm-button--primary:hover {
    background-color: #445626;
  }

  .content-section {
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  .content-section h2,
  .pricing-section h2,
  .faq-section h2,
  .final-cta-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .content-section p,
  .pricing-section p,
  .faq-section p,
  .final-cta-section p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .feature-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.05rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .feature-list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.5em;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background-color: var(--kbm-green-2);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .checkmark-list li::before {
    content: "\2713";
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    top: 0;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
  }

  .numbered-list {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .numbered-list li {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.05rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .numbered-list li strong {
    color: var(--kbm-green);
  }

  .benefits-list {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .benefit-item {
    background: #f9fdf5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--kbm-green-2);
  }

  .benefit-item h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .benefit-item p {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.4vw, 1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pricing-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f1f6ec 0%, #e9ece7 100%);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-height, 6rem) + 1rem);
  }

  .pricing-section h2 {
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pricing-intro {
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  }

  .pricing-features {
    max-width: 450px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .faq-section {
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  .faq-item {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e8e0;
  }

  .faq-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .faq-item h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.8vw, 1.15rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--kbm-green);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .faq-item p {
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.4vw, 1rem);
    color: #5a6b47;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .final-cta-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .final-cta-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .final-cta-text {
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sales-page {
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem;
    }

    .pricing-section {
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .benefit-item {
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .kbm-button {
      padding: 0.65rem 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  }
</style>
